        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 24\" Modern Rectangular Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis new contemporary rectangular door pull was designed by First Impressions International, a leader in door pull concepts. They are hand made and finished in the USA. Available in your choice of 3 high quality powder coated, extra long lasting finish choices.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 3250ALM  Modern Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Non-Rusting Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 3</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This rectangular door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
